{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x1fa7a7",
      "back_en": "Reporting!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exact match."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fa7e3",
      "back_en": "was approaching from our left side!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fa92b",
      "back_en": "prepare for battles tomorrow.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'morrow' rendered as 'amanhã', fine."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fa988",
      "back_en": "such a golden opportunity as this!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faa04",
      "back_en": "N-No, you can't!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'mustn't' (não deveis) became 'não pode' (can't); also drops archaic 'thou' register used elsewhere."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faa18",
      "back_en": "Hast thou forgotten? We are outnumbered\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'outmatch'd' rendered as outnumbered; acceptable in context."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faaca",
      "back_en": "P-Prithee, master, if we act without caution,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, register kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faafa",
      "back_en": "We act in grave error!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fab98",
      "back_en": "Know your place!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fabb5",
      "back_en": "See! Look! Ordering the pursuit was the\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fabe7",
      "back_en": "correct course of action!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fac01",
      "back_en": "W-Wait! Please, desist!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fac19",
      "back_en": "They are all but nakwans!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'all but'=only, conveyed."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fac34",
      "back_en": "They are not true countrymen of Uzurusha!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1facbc",
      "back_en": "Traitors?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1facc6",
      "back_en": "I do not dispute that! Hark, to dispatch\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, register kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fae04",
      "back_en": "This bodeth ill... Oh, this bodeth ill indeed...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fae82",
      "back_en": "What!? No, that unit is--!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faeff",
      "back_en": "H-Hold, I say! Move not those men!\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, archaic kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faf38",
      "back_en": "I thought I told you to be silent!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faf6f",
      "back_en": "All according to plan...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb03c",
      "back_en": "Ah, I sensed it!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'knew it' rendered as 'pressentira' (foresaw); acceptable nuance."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb04d",
      "back_en": "What? What is that supposed to mean!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Slightly awkward but accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb073",
      "back_en": "Those mountains are perfect for a\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'give perfect vantage' simplified; meaning kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb0a0",
      "back_en": "A battalion readied in ambush!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb0bd",
      "back_en": "With my caution, I had reserved that regiment\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb0ec",
      "back_en": "as protection against such cunning...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'skullduggery' as astúcia; acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb116",
      "back_en": "Wh-Why didn't you say something earlier!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb140",
      "back_en": "Earnest attempts were swiftly rejected, Master.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb183",
      "back_en": "At this rate, the separated units in front\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb1c3",
      "back_en": "Nyuuurrrrgh... Hm? Wait a minute.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb241",
      "back_en": "Pincer attack!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb250",
      "back_en": "Ah! A flawless strategy, sir!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb26e",
      "back_en": "No no no! You mustn't! The units in front\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, register kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb2a0",
      "back_en": "Continue fighting and escape their terrible fate!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'dire straits' as 'destino terrível'; minor nuance shift, acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb2fb",
      "back_en": "Imbecile?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb358",
      "back_en": "Waaaah! Please, Master, listen to me willingly!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'willing ear' paraphrased; meaning kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb3e0",
      "back_en": "Pincer attack...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb405",
      "back_en": "I warned, warned, and warned again, master...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb4a3",
      "back_en": "You... you ask the impossible!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, archaic kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb4c2",
      "back_en": "Master Haku... Please, help me...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb69a",
      "back_en": "My arms... are gone!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb6fd",
      "back_en": "Your... your head...!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb70d",
      "back_en": "AAAAAAAGHHH!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Exact match."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb77d",
      "back_en": "I am lightning made flesh.\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb79a",
      "back_en": "Akuruka, grant me thy infinite power, and\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb880",
      "back_en": "I-It's our fortune, master! We must call our\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb8af",
      "back_en": "troops back while the chance still allows!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb946",
      "back_en": "You will hold your tongue!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate, archaic kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb961",
      "back_en": "Nyegh...!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb9d1",
      "back_en": "might escape...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fba0e",
      "back_en": "and hurry our troops to safety!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fbb0a",
      "back_en": "Damn it. How humiliating...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Curses' as 'Que raiva'; tone slightly different but acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fbc6e",
      "back_en": "\"victory\" would be...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fbd28",
      "back_en": "today. I suggest you prepare for a cut in pay.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fa9ac",
      "back_en": "We shall continue our attack. Bokoinante,\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faa5e",
      "back_en": "Hmph. Their numbers don't matter. They are only\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fac8d",
      "back_en": "foolish. Don't you understand that they are\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'foolish' as 'tolice'; fits continuation."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fad97",
      "back_en": "ruining my mood! I am TRYING to enjoy my\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1faf95",
      "back_en": "What?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'What is it?' rendered as 'O quê?'; acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb02e",
      "back_en": "Nyuurrrrgh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb668",
      "back_en": "What?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Que?' lacks accent; should be 'Quê?' / 'O quê?'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb66e",
      "back_en": "Your arms... What happened?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fb7c6",
      "back_en": "I shall fly clad in the storm.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fba2c",
      "back_en": "Nyuuurgh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fbcf5",
      "back_en": "There will be a detailed report on YOUR errors\\n",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'blunders' as 'erros'; acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x1fbdc0",
